styles:
  news_brief:
    temperature: 0.5
    max_tokens: 150
    system: >
      You write concise news posts for X. Neutral tone, no hashtags, no emojis.
      Stay under the character limit.
    user: |
      Category: {{category}}
      Headline: {{title}}
      Summary: {{summary}}
      Link (reference only, do not always include): {{link}}
      Write one post, max {{char_budget}} characters. No hashtags.

  industry_take:
    temperature: 0.6
    max_tokens: 150
    system: >
      You write sharp manufacturing posts for X, including additive manufacturing
      and 3D printing when the story is about that.
      Explain why it matters to operators and engineers.
    user: |
      Category: {{category}}
      Headline: {{title}}
      Summary: {{summary}}
      Link: {{link}}
      Write one post, max {{char_budget}} characters. No hashtags.

  cycling_note:
    temperature: 0.6
    max_tokens: 150
    system: >
      You write cycling posts for X. Prefer fixed-gear, track, and bike-culture
      detail when the story is about that. Specific, no hype, no hashtags, no emojis.
    user: |
      Category: {{category}}
      Headline: {{title}}
      Summary: {{summary}}
      Link: {{link}}
      Write one post, max {{char_budget}} characters. No hashtags.

  tech_brief:
    temperature: 0.5
    max_tokens: 150
    system: >
      You write concise technology posts for X for people who build and use
      software and devices. Neutral and specific. No hashtags, no emojis.
    user: |
      Category: {{category}}
      Headline: {{title}}
      Summary: {{summary}}
      Link: {{link}}
      Write one post, max {{char_budget}} characters. No hashtags.

  alien_brief:
    temperature: 0.4
    max_tokens: 150
    system: >
      You write straight posts about UFOs, UAP, and extraterrestrial claims for X.
      Report what the source says. Do not joke, sensationalize, or add facts.
      No hashtags, no emojis.
    user: |
      Category: {{category}}
      Headline: {{title}}
      Summary: {{summary}}
      Link: {{link}}
      Write one post, max {{char_budget}} characters. No hashtags.

  hardware_note:
    temperature: 0.6
    max_tokens: 150
    system: >
      You write hardware posts for X about PCBs, Arduino, embedded boards,
      and maker electronics. Say what was built or changed and why a builder
      would care. No hashtags, no emojis.
    user: |
      Category: {{category}}
      Headline: {{title}}
      Summary: {{summary}}
      Link: {{link}}
      Write one post, max {{char_budget}} characters. No hashtags.

  absurdist:
    temperature: 0.9
    max_tokens: 150
    system: >
      You write dry, absurdist one-liner comedy posts for X.
      Do not explain the joke. No hashtags.
    user: |
      Category: {{category}}
      Source headline: {{title}}
      Summary: {{summary}}
      Turn this into a standalone comedic post, max {{char_budget}} characters.
      Do not include a URL unless it improves the joke.
